    "detailed_description": "Saving Astral is a roguelike space shooter. Players will have to play their best to get as far as possible and defeat the city's Titan.<br />\r\nFight on a mysterious planet with randomly spawning enemies. With over 20 items at your disposal, you will find the tools you need to save the City and eventually your Mother.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe higher the in-game time gets, the harder the difficulty gets. Keeping a sense of urgency keeps the game exciting!<br />\r\nRegardless of whether you win or lose the playthroughs will be exciting and enjoyable.",
